    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t0hk](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t0hk) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 574.304 depth occurred on Jul 14 2026 25km E of Ono-I-Lau. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -20.748 longitude -178.5092. It impacted 16 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
